<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-20T18:34:55.161Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:34:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-linked militants attacked civilians in Mali's Menaka region, killing dozens of people. Mali's military and allied armed groups continue to commit abuses against civilians. The violence is concentrated in the Sahel, especially Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso, where the multi-sided conflict has persisted since 2012. The latest reports describe a large civilian massacre by jihadist fighters, adding to ongoing attacks on non-combatants. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE5GbTE5XzFvVTV1Tkx3OHVqaWt5a1FjLXZONEs2WF9UWU9DaDdBNGlvV0dzRG5pcDVQa1Y3MGRIWGlSUmV1bVhtRzR0MFRLRXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة سبأ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNRlAzMTVwWXpjQ3Z4RzIyck12Y1djMDh6a3QzVVRZOWVWN21JRGJzRVk2ZURQYjk0MVhTWVlmVGtNMnRPdlVZOFV1UGhycHZFa0N1OWxxNmNvVTJ5dVB2TXJ3anRoZ0VJSHMzZXdsWmN2Z0E1enJfUTlsZkVIZ1p6Tm1sLW0tREE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channels Television&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOYlpVY0N6YlY3b2JxcWJyYjBvcjV5TFg1MzF4WDFYV1E2Z0tpaFFYQ0ZrTVBFU1RTdGt4aXFfNUFPWlltUW5BWERPSFl0QkVlUTk5STlHUHpjQlRMVnEyMF95VTkxVmRPT0FQclB5RHlSYS1DTU1mbmpyX3kzODJadmF4czd5RjlSWWU3ekI3YUlBSS1XeWE5eldwTlpxamNwSXg4TG9PVk5QMnk5UllXOVZ1ZElib3Z5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigeria Info FM&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;vijesti.me&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOQWlocmUzU19zUGNZZHJtRHNDOE83Ym5SNnVuck1DY0JQTTJWT0htNGIweFBDNlRvdlN2bWhpSE